@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Block a request to an origin off the list
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Frontend — Ride app" #E0F2FE
  participant "Injected or mistaken code" as code
  participant "PhotorealTiles" as tiles
end box
participant "Chrome or Edge (CSP enforcement)" as browser
participant "Google Maps Platform" as gmaps
participant "Other origin" as other
code -> browser : fetch("https://tracker.example/collect")
browser -> browser : connect-src does not list the origin
browser --> code : Blocked; securitypolicyviolation event (L2-131 AC3)
note over other : Never contacted
== Rider has given a Google key ==
tiles -> browser : fetch tiles from https://tile.googleapis.com with the key
browser -> gmaps : Allowed by connect-src
gmaps --> tiles : Tiles
note over tiles : Without a key, no request to Google is made (L2-066)
@enduml
